Hi all,

Two of our London vans go in for their yearly service next week:

- Van 2 on Tuesday 14 July
- Van 4 on Thursday 16 July

The garage collects each van from the warehouse at 16:30 the evening before and brings it back by 15:00 on the service day. On those two days we will use the hire van, which will be parked in bay 1. The keys are in the key box in the warehouse office.

Tom and Aisha, your routes are the ones affected. Please load the hire van the evening before, as you would with your own van, and check the tyres and lights before you leave.

If you notice anything wrong with your van before the service, such as a warning light or a noise, write it on the sheet by the key box so the garage can look at it.

Kind regards,
